{
  "id": 8837155815623,
  "title": "Custom Wolf Wearing Headdress Centered Close Up Quilt with Wolf Head",
  "handle": "custom-wolf-wearing-headdress-centered-close-up-comforter-with-wolf-head-2d14ed690a-2d14ed690a",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in comfort and spirit with this customized Native American inspired quilt. Designed with a striking, colorful theme on smooth material, this quilt serves as both a cozy layer for your bed and a beautiful decorative statement piece. Perfect for snuggling up on the sofa while reading, relaxing, or enjoying family time, it provides the perfect amount of warmth for all seasons.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Features a dedicated text input field to customize with your own name or personal request.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Native American Inspired Design:</strong> Beautiful digital illustration showcasing a close-up of a wolf centered wearing a detailed ceremonial headdress with feathers, beads, and dreamcatcher elements.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Comfort:</strong> High-quality print quilt that is soft, lightweight, breathable, and durable—designed to keep you cool in the summer and warm in the winter.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bed and couch lounging, or outdoor adventures like camping and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying microfiber fabric fluffs up beautifully after air drying.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes one quilt, with the option to complete your bedding set by adding two matching pillow covers (20x30 inches).</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>30% Cotton, 70% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Native Wolf 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Rustic</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Native</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Subject Character</th>\n<td>Wolf</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
